title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> INITIAL_STATE
INITIAL_STATE --> StartJoin : [Valid]

state StartJoin <<choice>>
StartJoin --> Registration
StartJoin --> Authentication
StartJoin --> SearchBooks
StartJoin --> GetBooksState
StartJoin --> BuyBooks

